<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">You turn the computer on, wait for the sign-in screen, enter your password—and then wait again. By the time email opens, you have forgotten what you sat down to do.</p>
<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">Before changing settings or buying a replacement, work out where the waiting happens. “Slow to start” can describe several different experiences. A useful first step is to describe yours clearly.</p>
